# On the stack a split card is only the half being cast, and has that half's mana value (CR 709.3b, 202.3d); in every other
# zone it has the combined mana cost (CR 709.4b), here 8. Bot1's Chalice of the Void with two counters (X = 2, four mana)
# counters Bot2's Cease, mana value 2: Bot2 neither gains 2 life (it stays on the 17 Bot1's Bolt left it) nor draws,
# and the Bolt stays in Bot1's graveyard.

